logs/*.log*  # .log, and the rotated .log.1 .. .log.5 -- they carry titles, prices and your email address
.DS_Store

# data/seen_listings.json and data/ebay_alert_price_history.json are
# intentionally NOT ignored: the daily-scan.yml GitHub Actions workflow
# commits them back to the repo after each run, since the runner is thrown
# away otherwise and dedupe/comp history would reset to empty every day.
# If you only ever run this locally (no GitHub Actions), they'll just sit
# as regular tracked files -- still fine, just commit their changes (or
# not) like any other file.
